msgid "Stage summary event (example):"
msgstr "This event is emitted when a stage of the translation process is completed. It contains a summary of the stage, including the number of pages processed, the time taken, and any errors encountered.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"stage_summary\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"stage\": \"translation\",\n    \"pages_processed\": 10,\n    \"time_taken\": 30.5,\n    \"errors\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### TRANSLATION RESULT\n\n階段摘要事件（範例）：此事件在翻譯過程的某個階段完成時發出。它包含該階段的摘要，包括處理的頁數、花費的時間以及遇到的任何錯誤。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"stage_summary\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"stage\": \"translation\",\n    \"pages_processed\": 10,\n    \"time_taken\": 30.5,\n    \"errors\": []\n  }\n}\n```"

