msgid "### Getting Started\n"
msgstr "### 開始使用\n"

# This content is from "getting-started.md", line 3
msgctxt "chunk_5534569E"
msgid "BilingualPDF is a powerful PDF translation tool. You can install and start using this tool in various ways.\n"
msgstr "BilingualPDF 是一個強大的 PDF 翻譯工具。您可以通過多種方式安裝並開始使用此工具。\n"

# This content is from "getting-started.md", line 7
msgctxt "chunk_36D1B1ED"
msgid "### Installation\n"
msgstr "### 如何安裝\n"

# This content is from "getting-started.md", line 9
